OL,3,GNEWSAEMR services increased after
OL,4,Aissues with new fleet
OL,5,
OL,6,FEast Midlands Railway (EMR) has
OL,7,Fannounced it is increasing services
OL,8,Fafter they were reduced due to issues
OL,9,Fwith a new fleet of trains.
OL,11,FThe operator reduced its Intercity
OL,12,Ftimetable, which runs to and from
OL,13,FLondon St Pancras, to 87% in July after
OL,14,Fexperiencing problems with its new
OL,15,FAurora (Class 810) trains, built by
OL,16,FHitachi Rail.
OL,23,APub: 30-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBC Eng (E) NewsCReg TVFWeather
FL,362,360,200,160,0,100
PN,36102
