OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F361A1790781960
OL,1,W5j 5Q7+ js17kjc15 js57kj#4
OL,2,W//%*// //%Q-. *,$%**,%-,* %%**,! ,$A(E)
OL,3,GNEWSAEMR services increased after
OL,4,Aissues with new fleet
OL,5,
OL,6,FFollowing "improved operational
OL,7,Fstability", EMR increased its Intercity
OL,8,Foperation from 87% to 92% on 1
OL,9,FSeptember, and said it now has "greater
OL,10,Fconfidence" in increasing it to 96%
OL,11,Ffrom 19 October.
OL,13,FNeil Grabham, interim managing director
OL,14,Fat East Midlands Railway, said
OL,15,Frestoring services "will provide
OL,16,Fgreater choice and flexibility for
OL,17,Fthose travelling to and from London".
OL,23,APub: 30-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG2/2
